# Mystify Orbit Admin Panel - Local Development Overrides
# Overrides .env for local dev. Vite loads this automatically when running `npm run dev`.
# Empty values force authService/mediaUploadService to use relative paths (e.g. /v1/auth/send-otp)
# which the Vite dev server proxy then forwards to the real backend — avoiding CORS issues.

# Leave these EMPTY so Vite proxy handles all API traffic:
VITE_USER_MS_URL=
VITE_AUTH_MS_URL=
VITE_QUESTION_MS_URL=
